---
description: InfraLens project rules
globs: ["**/*.py", "**/*.md", "**/*.toml", "**/*.yml", "**/*.yaml"]
alwaysApply: true
---
Read `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `DECISIONS.md`, and `TASKS.md` before major work.
Preserve point-in-time validity; never introduce future-data leakage.
Keep financial outputs deterministic and covered by tests.
Compare ML models to seasonal-naive and regularized-linear baselines.
Do not change target, geography, success criteria, or final holdout without recording the decision.
Prefer small reproducible modules over notebook-only implementation.
